From d232e58ddbc38ddc46ee6bba38c389f4454109cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:03:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] select options: carry only what identifies a user or an
 email profile

The user select option returned each person's email address as its
description and meta, and searched by it; the email profile option
returned the sender address and provider. Select options are reference
reads anyone signed in can make, and the reference views of both kinds
carry only a name (and a user's username and picture). The user option
now carries the name and username and searches only those; the email
profile option carries only its name, and the REST select queries pick
and search only those columns. The comment mention picker and the email
profile picker show the username and name instead.

